"description":"LockTodoNote helps you keep your todos, notes, calendar cards, image cards, and D-Day reminders visible on your iPhone Lock Screen.\n\nAdd a quick todo, save a memo, or check today’s plan without opening the app. With Live Activities and Shortcuts, your important tasks stay right where you can see them.\n\nLockTodoNote helps you see your day right from your iPhone Lock Screen.\n\nKeep your calendar, todos, and memos together in one simple daily view. Check what matters today without opening a full planner app every time.\n\nLockTodoNote is designed for quick, visible planning:\nsee your calendar on the left, your todos and memos on the right, and update your day as things change.\n\nWHY LockTodoNote?\n\n• Lock Screen Daily View\nSee today’s calendar, todos, and memos directly on your Lock Screen.\n\n• Calendar + Todo + Memo\nPick a date and view what belongs to that day. Todos and memos stay organized by date.\n\n• Mini Calendar\nUse a compact calendar view to understand your day at a glance.\n\n• Todo Check-Off\nComplete todos quickly. Checked tasks disappear from the Lock Screen so only unfinished tasks stay visible.\n\n• Memos Without Checkboxes\nAdd notes that do not need completion. Memos use a note icon, so they are easy to tell apart from todos.\n\n• Fast Add\nQuickly add a todo or memo for the selected date.\n\n• Lock Screen Actions\nUse shortcuts and quick actions to add items and update your Lock Screen view faster.\n\n• Dynamic Island Support\nSee a compact summary of your day on supported iPhone models.\n\n• Simple Settings\nCustomize how your Lock Screen card appears, including calendar style, memo visibility, and completed todo visibility.\n\nUSE LockTodoNote FOR\n\n• Today’s tasks\n• School or work reminders\n• Errands\n• Appointments\n• Shopping notes\n• Meeting notes\n• Daily routines\n• Things you do not want to forget\n\nTODO VS MEMO\n\nTodos are for things you need to finish.\nMemos are for things you only need to remember.\n\nA todo can be checked off.\nA memo stays as a note.\n\nThis makes LockTodoNote useful for both action items and simple information you want to keep visible.\n\nYOUR DAY, ALWAYS VISIBLE\n\nLockTodoNote is not a complex project management app.\nIt is a simple Lock Screen daily planner for the things you need to see today.\n\nOpen your iPhone.\nCheck your date.\nSee your todos and memos.\nFinish tasks.\nRemember what matters.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://motionfit.fit/locktodonote/privacy/", "averageUserRating":0, "trackCensoredName":"LockTodoNote: Lock Screen Todo", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/locktodonote-lock-screen-todo/id6783183501?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "userRatingCount":0}]
